<h2 class="comicinfo-sync-title">ComicInfo.xml</h2>
<p class="comicinfo-sync-hint">
    Writes the series, title, volume, authors, publisher, date and ISBN of your digital books into the ComicInfo.xml of their archive.
    The other information of the file is kept.
</p>

<div class="comicinfo-sync">
    <button type="button" class="comicinfo-sync-button" disabled="@_isStarting" @onclick="StartAsync">
        @(_isStarting ? "Starting…" : "Update ComicInfo.xml")
    </button>
</div>
